window.ADDIV = {"src":"Missale O.P. (1939): Orationes ad diversa, pp. 100*-113*; Orationes ad supplendum numerum ternarium, pp. 636-638; In Vigilia Epiphaniae, pp. 32-33","sets":{"d1":{"n":1,"la":"Ad poscenda suffragia omnium Sanctorum","en":"For the prayers of all the Saints","or":{"la":"Concéde, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut intercéssio sanctæ Dei Genitrícis semper Vírginis Maríæ, sanctarúmque ómnium cæléstium Virtútum, et beatórum Patriarchárum, Prophetárum, Apostolórum, Mártyrum, Confessórum, atque Vírginum, et ómnium electórum tuórum, nos ubíque lætíficet; ut dum eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia sentiámus:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the intercession of the holy Mother of God, Mary ever Virgin, and of all the heavenly Powers, and of the blessed Patriarchs, Prophets, Apostles, Martyrs, Confessors and Virgins, and of all Your elect, may everywhere gladden us; that while we recall their merits, we may feel their patronage","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Oblátis Dómine placáre munéribus: et intercedénte beáta Dei Genitríce semper Vírgine María cum ómnibus Sanctis, a cunctis nos defénde perículis.","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Be appeased, O Lord, by the gifts we offer; and at the intercession of the blessed Mother of God, Mary ever Virgin, with all the Saints, defend us from all dangers","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Súmpsimus, Dómine, beátæ Maríæ semper Vírginis, et ómnium Sanctórum tuórum memóriam recoléntes, sacraménta cæléstia: præsta quǽsumus, ut quod temporáliter gérimus; eórum précibus adiúti, ætérnis gáudiis consequámur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Having received, O Lord, the heavenly sacraments, as we recall the memory of blessed Mary ever Virgin and of all Your Saints, grant, we beseech You, that what we do in time we may attain in everlasting joys, helped by their prayers","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Concéde, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus"},"d2":{"n":2,"la":"Alia Oratio ut supra (A cunctis)","en":"Another for the prayers of the Saints (A cunctis)","or":{"la":"A cunctis nos, quǽsumus Dómine, mentis et córporis defénde perículis: et intercedénte beáta et gloriósa semper Vírgine Dei Genitríce María, cum beáto Ioseph, beátis Apóstolis tuis Petro et Paulo, atque beáto Domínico Patre nostro, et ómnibus Sanctis, salútem nobis tríbue benígnus, et pacem; ut destrúctis adversitátibus et erróribus univérsis, Ecclésia tua secúra tibi sérviat libertáte:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Defend us, we beseech You, O Lord, from all dangers of mind and body; and at the intercession of the blessed and glorious Mary, ever Virgin, Mother of God, with blessed Joseph, Your blessed Apostles Peter and Paul, blessed Dominic our Father, and all the Saints, mercifully grant us safety and peace; that, all adversities and errors being overcome, Your Church may serve You in security and freedom","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"se":{"la":"Exáudi nos Deus salutáris noster: ut per huius sacraménti virtútem a cunctis nos mentis et córporis hóstibus tueáris, grátiam tríbuens in præsénti, et glóriam in futúro.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Graciously hear us, O God our Saviour, that by the power of this sacrament You may defend us from all enemies of mind and body, giving us grace in this present life and glory in the life to come","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Mundet et múniat nos, quǽsumus Dómine, divíni sacraménti munus oblátum: et intercedénte beáta Vírgine Dei Genitríce María, cum beáto Ioseph, beátis Apóstolis tuis Petro et Paulo, atque beáto Domínico Patre nostro, et ómnibus Sanctis; a cunctis nos reddat et perversitátibus expiátos, et adversitátibus expedítos:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the offering of this divine sacrament cleanse and strengthen us, we beseech You, O Lord; and at the intercession of the blessed Virgin Mary, Mother of God, with blessed Joseph, Your blessed Apostles Peter and Paul, blessed Dominic our Father, and all the Saints, may it make us cleansed from all wickedness and set free from all adversity","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"A cunctis"},"d3":{"n":3,"la":"De Sanctis Ordinis nostri","en":"Of the Saints of our Order","or":{"la":"Concéde, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut ad meliórem vitam Sanctórum tuórum Ordinis nostri exémpla nos próvocent; quátenus quorum memóriam ágimus, étiam actus imitémur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the examples of Your Saints of our Order may stir us to a better life; so that, as we celebrate their memory, we may also imitate their deeds","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Múnera tibi, Dómine, nostræ devotiónis offérimus: quæ et pro tuórum tibi grata sint honóre Sanctórum Ordinis nostri; et nobis salutária, te miseránte, reddántur.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"We offer You, O Lord, the gifts of our devotion; may they be pleasing to You in honour of Your Saints of our Order, and by Your mercy be made salutary for us","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Præsta nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, intercedéntibus Sanctis tuis Ordinis nostri; ut quæ ore contígimus, pura mente capiámus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, by the intercession of Your Saints of our Order, that what we have touched with our lips we may receive with a pure mind","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Concéde, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus"},"d4":{"n":4,"la":"De Sanctis, quorum reliquiæ sunt in ecclesia","en":"Of the Saints whose relics are in the church","or":{"la":"Concéde, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut sancta Dei Génitrix, atque omnes Sancti, quorum relíquiæ in ista recondúntur ecclésia, suis patrocíniis ubíque nos ádiuvent; quátenus, illórum præsénti suffrágio, tranquílla pace in tua laude lætémur:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the holy Mother of God and all the Saints whose relics are laid up in this church may everywhere help us by their patronage; that, by their present aid, we may rejoice in Your praise in tranquil peace","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Múnera tua, miséricors Deus, maiestáti tuæ obláta benígno, quǽsumus, súscipe intúitu: ut eórum nobis précibus fiant salutária, quorum benedíctas in ecclésia ista relíquias venerámur.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Receive with a kindly regard, we beseech You, merciful God, the gifts offered to Your majesty, that they may be made salutary for us by the prayers of those whose blessed relics we venerate in this church","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Divína, Dómine, libántes mystéria, te deprecámur: ut per mérita Sanctórum, quorum venerábiles relíquiæ in ista requiéscunt ecclésia, peccatórum nostrórum véniam mereámur; et cæléstis grátiæ donis reficiámur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Partaking of the divine mysteries, O Lord, we beseech You that, through the merits of the Saints whose venerable relics rest in this church, we may obtain pardon of our sins and be refreshed with the gifts of heavenly grace","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Concéde, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus"},"d5":{"n":5,"la":"Pro omni gradu Ecclesiæ","en":"For every rank of the Church","or":{"la":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, cuius Spíritu totum corpus Ecclésiæ sanctificátur, et régitur: exáudi nos pro univérsis ordínibus supplicántes; ut grátiæ tuæ múnere ab ómnibus tibi grádibus fidéliter serviátur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty, everlasting God, by whose Spirit the whole body of the Church is sanctified and governed, hear us as we pray for all its orders; that by the gift of Your grace You may be faithfully served by every rank","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Da fámulis tuis, Dómine, indulgéntiam peccatórum, consolatiónem vitæ, gubernatiónem perpétuam: ut tibi serviéntes, ad tuam iúgiter misericórdiam perveníre mereántur.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant to Your servants, O Lord, pardon of sins, comfort in life and Your continual guidance; that, serving You, they may come at last to Your mercy","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Líbera, quǽsumus Dómine, a peccátis et hóstibus fámulos tuos tibi supplicántes: ut in sancta conversatióne vivéntes; nullis afficiántur advérsis:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Deliver, we beseech You, O Lord, from sins and enemies Your servants who make supplication to You; that, living in holy conversation, they may be harmed by no adversities","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, cuius"},"d6":{"n":6,"la":"Pro Papa vel Episcopo","en":"For the Pope or the Bishop","or":{"la":"Deus ómnium fidélium pastor et rector, fámulum tuum N. quem pastórem Ecclésiæ tuæ præésse voluísti, propítius réspice: da ei, quǽsumus, verbo et exémplo, quibus præest, profícere; ut ad vitam, una cum grege sibi crédito, pervéniat sempitérnam: Per Dóminum.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, the shepherd and ruler of all the faithful, look down in mercy upon Your servant N., whom You have willed to preside over Your Church as her shepherd; grant him, we beseech You, so to profit by word and example those over whom he is set, that together with the flock entrusted to him he may attain to everlasting life","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"se":{"la":"Oblátis, quǽsumus Dómine, placáre munéribus; et fámulum tuum N. quem pastórem Ecclésiæ tuæ præésse voluísti, assídua protectióne gubérna.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Be appeased, we beseech You, O Lord, by the gifts we offer, and govern with Your continual protection Your servant N., whom You have willed to preside over Your Church as her shepherd","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"pc":{"la":"Hæc nos, quǽsumus Dómine, divíni sacraménti percéptio prótegat; et fámulum tuum N. quem pastórem Ecclésiæ tuæ præésse voluísti, una cum commísso sibi grege, salvet semper et múniat:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the reception of this divine sacrament protect us, we beseech You, O Lord, and may it ever save and defend Your servant N., whom You have willed to preside over Your Church as her shepherd, together with the flock committed to him","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"note":"Si pro Epíscopo dicuntur istæ oratiónes, post Ecclésiæ pronuntiátur nomen diœcésis. Si eádem die dici debent pro Papa et pro Epíscopo, assumántur pro Papa Oratiónes sequéntes.","inc":"Deus ómnium fidélium"},"d7":{"n":7,"la":"Contra persecutores Ecclesiæ","en":"Against the persecutors of the Church","or":{"la":"Ecclésiæ tuæ, quǽsumus Dómine, preces placátus admítte: ut destrúctis adversitátibus et erróribus univérsis; secúra tibi sérviat libertáte:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Graciously receive, we beseech You, O Lord, the prayers of Your Church; that, all adversities and errors being destroyed, she may serve You in security and freedom","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"se":{"la":"Prótege nos, Dómine, tuis mystériis serviéntes: ut divínis rebus inhæréntes, et córpore tibi famulémur, et mente.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Protect us, O Lord, who serve Your mysteries; that, cleaving to things divine, we may serve You both in body and in mind","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"pc":{"la":"Quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut quos divína tríbuis participatióne gaudére; humánis non sinas subiacére perículis:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"We beseech You, O Lord our God, that You suffer not to be exposed to human dangers those to whom You grant to rejoice in partaking of divine things","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Ecclésiæ tuæ, quǽsumus Dómine"},"d8":{"n":8,"la":"Pro Imperatore","en":"For the Emperor","or":{"la":"Deus regnórum ómnium, et christiáni máxime protéctor Impérii: da servo tuo si non est coronátus (elécto) Imperatóri nostro N. triúmphum virtútis tuæ sciénter excólere; ut qui tua institutióne est princeps, tuo sit semper múnere potens:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, protector of all kingdoms and above all of the Christian Empire, grant to Your servant our Emperor (if he is not yet crowned: Emperor-elect) N. to make wise use of the triumph of Your power; that he who is prince by Your appointment may ever be strong by Your gift","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Súscipe, Dómine, preces et hóstias Ecclésiæ tuæ pro salúte fámuli tui supplicántis: et in protectióne fidélium populórum, antíqua bráchii tui operáre mirácula; ut superátis pacis inimícis, secúra tibi sérviat christiána libértas.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Receive, O Lord, the prayers and offerings of Your Church for the welfare of Your servant who makes supplication to You, and in the protection of the faithful peoples work the ancient wonders of Your arm; that, the enemies of peace being overcome, Christian liberty may serve You in security","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Deus, qui ad prædicándum ætérni Regis Evangélium, Románum impérium præparásti: præténde fámulo tuo Imperatóri nostro N. arma cæléstia; ut pax Ecclesiárum nulla turbétur tempestáte bellórum:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who prepared the Roman Empire for the preaching of the Gospel of the eternal King, stretch forth heavenly arms to Your servant our Emperor N.; that the peace of the Churches may be troubled by no storm of war","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus regnórum ómnium, et"},"d9":{"n":9,"la":"Pro Rege","en":"For the King","or":{"la":"Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut fámulus tuus N. Rex noster, qui tua miseratióne suscépit regni gubernácula; virtútum étiam ómnium percípiat increménta: quibus decénter ornátus, et vitiórum monstra devitáre; et ad te, qui via, véritas et vita es, gratiósus váleat perveníre:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"We beseech You, almighty God, that Your servant N., our King, who by Your mercy has received the government of the realm, may also receive an increase of all virtues; that, fittingly adorned with them, he may shun the monstrous growth of vice, and, being pleasing to You, come at last to You, who are the way, the truth and the life","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Múnera, quǽsumus Dómine, obláta sanctífica: ut et nobis Unigéniti tui corpus et sanguis fiant; et Regi nostro ad obtinéndam ánimæ corporisque salútem, et ad peragéndum iniúnctum officium, te largiénte usquequáque profíciant.","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Sanctify, we beseech You, O Lord, the gifts we offer, that they may become for us the Body and Blood of Your Only-begotten Son, and by Your bounty may in every way profit our King, for obtaining health of soul and body and for fulfilling the office laid upon him","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Hæc, Dómine, oblátio salutáris fámulum tuum N. Regem nostrum ab ómnibus tueátur advérsis: quátenus et ecclesiásticæ pacis obtíneat tranquillitátem; et post huius témporis decúrsum, ad ætérnam pervéniat hereditátem:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May this saving oblation, O Lord, protect Your servant N., our King, from all adversities; that he may obtain the tranquillity of the Church's peace, and after the course of this life come to the everlasting inheritance","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut"},"d10":{"n":10,"la":"Pro Prælatis, et Congregationibus eis commissis","en":"For Prelates and the congregations committed to them","or":{"la":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui facis mirabília magna solus; præténde super fámulos tuos, et super congregatiónes illis commíssas spíritum grátiæ salutáris: et ut in veritáte tibi compláceant; perpétuum eis rorem tuæ benedictiónis infúnde:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty, everlasting God, who alone do great wonders, send down upon Your servants and upon the congregations committed to them the spirit of saving grace; and, that they may please You in truth, pour forth upon them the continual dew of Your blessing","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Hóstias, Dómine, famulórum tuórum placátus inténde: et quas in honórem nóminis tui devóta mente pro eis celebrámus, profícere sibi séntiant ad medélam.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Look favourably, O Lord, on the offerings of Your servants; and grant that the sacrifice which we celebrate for them with devout mind in honour of Your name may profit them unto healing","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Quos cælésti récreas múnere, perpétuo, Dómine, comitáre præsídio: et quos fovére non désinis; dignos fíeri sempitérna redemptióne concéde:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Accompany with Your continual protection, O Lord, those whom You refresh with the heavenly gift; and grant that those whom You cease not to cherish may be made worthy of everlasting redemption","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui"},"d11":{"n":11,"la":"Pro Prædicatoribus","en":"For preachers","or":{"la":"Corda famulórum tuórum, Dómine, illúmina Spíritus Sancti grátia: ignítum eis elóquium dona; et iis, qui tuum prǽdicant verbum, largíre virtútis augméntum:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Enlighten, O Lord, the hearts of Your servants with the grace of the Holy Spirit; give them fiery speech, and to those who preach Your word grant an increase of power","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"se":{"la":"Fámulis tuis, Dómine, verbum tríbue gratiósum: et múnera obláta sanctíficans, corda eórum in salutári tuo, quǽsumus, vísita.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant Your servants, O Lord, a word of grace; and, hallowing the gifts we offer, visit their hearts, we beseech You, with Your salvation","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"pc":{"la":"Consérva Dómine fámulos tuos, Unigéniti tui córpore et sánguine suscépto; et tuum nuntiántibus verbum, largitátem tríbue gratiárum:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Preserve, O Lord, Your servants who have received the Body and Blood of Your Only-begotten Son; and to those who proclaim Your word grant an abundance of graces","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Corda famulórum tuórum, Dómine"},"d12":{"n":12,"la":"Pro Religiosis","en":"For religious","or":{"la":"Deus, qui nos a sǽculi vanitáte convérsos ad bravíum supérnæ vocatiónis accéndis: grátiam nobis, qua in te perseverémus, infúnde; ut nostræ professiónis exsecutóres effécti, quod te donánte promísimus, iúgiter impleámus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who kindle us, turned from the vanity of the world, toward the prize of our heavenly calling, pour forth upon us the grace to persevere in You; that, faithfully carrying out our profession, we may ever accomplish what by Your gift we have promised","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"se":{"la":"Tibi, Dómine Deus noster, devotiónis hóstiam immolántes, humíliter pétimus: ut nos sacrifícium tuum, mortificatióne vitæ carnális, accípias; ac móribus, quibus professióni nostræ congruámus, instítuas.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Offering to You, O Lord our God, the victim of our devotion, we humbly ask that You would accept us as Your sacrifice through the mortification of carnal life, and form us in the manners that befit our profession","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Deus, qui renuntiántibus sǽculo mansiónes prǽparas in cælo; diláta corda nostra cæléstibus bonis: ut concórdet nostra vita cum nómine; et proféssio sentiátur in ópere:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who prepare mansions in heaven for those who renounce the world, enlarge our hearts with heavenly gifts; that our life may accord with our name, and our profession be seen in our deeds","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"inc":"Deus, qui nos a"},"d13":{"n":13,"la":"Pro seipso Sacerdote","en":"For the priest himself","or":{"la":"Omnípotens et miséricors Deus, humilitátis meæ preces benígnus inténde: et me fámulum tuum, quem nullis suffragántibus méritis, sed imménsa cleméntiæ tuæ largitáte, cæléstibus mystériis servíre tribuísti, dignum sacris altáribus fac minístrum; ut quod mea voce deprómitur, tua sanctificatióne firmétur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty and merciful God, graciously hear the prayers of my lowliness; and make me, Your servant, whom You have granted to serve the heavenly mysteries, with no merits to commend me but by the boundless bounty of Your mercy, a worthy minister of Your holy altars; that what is uttered by my voice may be confirmed by Your sanctification","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Huius, Dómine, virtúte sacraménti, peccatórum meórum máculas abstérge: et præsta, ut ad exsequendum iniúncti offícii ministérium, me tua grátia dignum effíciat.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"By the power of this sacrament, O Lord, wipe away the stains of my sins; and grant that by Your grace it may make me worthy to carry out the ministry of the office laid upon me","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"pc":{"la":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui me peccatórem sacris altáribus astáre voluísti; et sancti nóminis tui laudáre poténtiam: concéde propítius, per huius sacraménti mystérium, meórum mihi véniam peccatórum; ut tuæ maiestáti digne mérear famulári:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty, everlasting God, who have willed that I, a sinner, should stand at Your holy altars and praise the might of Your holy name, mercifully grant me through the mystery of this sacrament the pardon of my sins; that I may worthily serve Your majesty","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens et miséricors Deus"},"d14":{"n":14,"la":"Tempore Capituli, vel Concilii","en":"At the time of a Chapter or Council","or":{"la":"Infúnde, quǽsumus, fámulis tuis, Dómine, spíritum veritátis et pacis: ut quæ tibi plácita sunt, toto corde cognóscant; et ágnita tota virtúte secténtur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Pour forth, we beseech You, O Lord, upon Your servants the spirit of truth and peace; that they may know with their whole heart what is pleasing to You, and, having known it, follow it with all their strength","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Respíciat cleméntia tua, Dómine, múnera servórum tuórum, et grátiam tuæ miseratiónis illis impénde: ut quæ recta sint in óculis tuis, veráciter intélligant, et fiduciáliter exsequántur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May Your clemency, O Lord, look upon the gifts of Your servants, and bestow on them the grace of Your mercy; that they may truly understand what is right in Your eyes, and faithfully carry it out","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Da, quǽsumus miséricors Deus: ut sancta tua, quæ súmpsimus, fámulos tuos in voluntáte tua confírment; et honórem tui nóminis illos exquírere fáciant:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, we beseech You, merciful God, that the holy things we have received may confirm Your servants in Your will, and make them seek the honour of Your name","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Infúnde, quǽsumus, fámulis tuis"},"d15":{"n":15,"la":"Pro familiaribus et amicis","en":"For relatives and friends","or":{"la":"Deus, qui caritátis dona per grátiam Sancti Spíritus tuórum fidélium córdibus infudísti; da fámulis et famulábus tuis, pro quibus tuam deprecámur cleméntiam, salútem mentis et córporis: ut te tota virtúte díligant; et quæ tibi plácita sunt, tota dilectióne perfíciant:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who by the grace of the Holy Spirit have poured the gifts of charity into the hearts of Your faithful, grant to Your servants and handmaids, for whom we implore Your mercy, health of mind and body; that they may love You with all their strength, and with all their love do what is pleasing to You","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Miserére, quǽsumus Dómine, fámulis et famulábus tuis, pro quibus hoc sacrifícium laudis tuæ offérimus maiestáti: ut per hæc sancta, supérnæ benedictiónis grátiam obtíneant, et glóriam ætérnæ beatitúdinis acquírant.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Have mercy, we beseech You, O Lord, on Your servants and handmaids for whom we offer to Your majesty this sacrifice of praise; that by these holy things they may obtain the grace of heavenly blessing and the glory of everlasting happiness","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Divína libántes mystéria, quǽsumus Dómine, ut hæc salutária sacraménta illis profíciant ad prosperitátem et pacem; pro quorum quarúmque dilectióne hæc tuæ obtúlimus maiestáti: Per Dóminum.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Partaking of the divine mysteries, we beseech You, O Lord, that these saving sacraments may profit unto prosperity and peace those for love of whom we have offered them to Your majesty","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui caritátis"},"d16":{"n":16,"la":"Pro familiaribus et amicis, alia","en":"For relatives and friends (another)","or":{"la":"Prætende Dómine fidélibus tuis déxteram cæléstis auxílii: ut te toto corde perquírant; et quæ digne póstulant, assequántur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Stretch forth, O Lord, to Your faithful the right hand of heavenly help; that they may seek You with their whole heart, and obtain what they rightly ask","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Propitiáre Dómine supplicatiónibus nostris; et has oblatiónes fidélium tuórum, quas tibi pro incolumitáte eórum offérimus, benígnus assúme: et ut nullíus sit írritum votum, nullíus vácua postulátio, præsta quǽsumus, ut quod fidéliter pétimus, efficáciter consequámur.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Be favourable, O Lord, to our supplications, and graciously accept these offerings of Your faithful, which we offer You for their welfare; and that no one's vow may be in vain, no one's petition empty, grant, we beseech You, that what we ask in faith we may effectually obtain","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Da fidélibus tuis, quǽsumus Dómine, in tua fide et sinceritáte constántiam: ut in caritáte divína firmáti; nullis tentatiónibus ab eius integritáte evellántur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant to Your faithful, we beseech You, O Lord, constancy in Your faith and sincerity; that, made firm in divine charity, they may be torn from its integrity by no temptations","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Prætende Dómine fidélibus tuis"},"d17":{"n":17,"la":"Pro benefactoribus","en":"For benefactors","or":{"la":"Inclína Dómine, quǽsumus, nobis aures tuæ pietátis: et benefactóribus nostris da peccatórum véniam, in bonis opéribus perseverántiam, ac in regno tuo magna pro parvis; et pro temporálibus prǽmia sempitérna concéde:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Incline to us, we beseech You, O Lord, the ears of Your mercy; and grant to our benefactors pardon of sins, perseverance in good works, and in Your kingdom great things for small, and everlasting rewards for temporal","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Súscipe, quǽsumus Dómine, munus tibi oblátum pro fámulis tuis, nobis bona faciéntibus; et concéde, ut quos tibi fecísti devótos, fácias in regno tuo tecum esse beátos.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Receive, we beseech You, O Lord, the gift offered to You for Your servants who do good to us; and grant that those whom You have made devoted to You, You may make blessed with You in Your kingdom","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Per hæc sancta sacraménta, quæ súmpsimus, Dómine, réspice super fámulos tuos benefactóres nostros: et præsta, ut sicut eórum devótio nobis est necessária; ita sit tibi semper accépta:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"By these holy sacraments which we have received, O Lord, look upon Your servants our benefactors; and grant that as their devotion is necessary to us, so it may ever be acceptable to You","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Inclína Dómine, quǽsumus, nobis"},"d18":{"n":18,"la":"Pro Congregatione et Familia","en":"For the congregation and household","or":{"la":"Defénde, quǽsumus Dómine, beáta María semper vírgine intercedénte, istam ab omni adversitáte famíliam; et toto corde tibi prostrátam, ab hóstium propítius tuére cleménter insídiis:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Defend, we beseech You, O Lord, by the intercession of blessed Mary ever Virgin, this family from all adversity; and as it lies prostrate before You with its whole heart, mercifully protect it from the snares of its enemies","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Súscipe, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus, oblatiónem nostræ devotiónis: et per virtútem huius sacraménti, fámulos tuos a cunctis adversitátibus prótege.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Receive, we beseech You, almighty God, the offering of our devotion; and by the power of this sacrament protect Your servants from all adversities","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Sumptis redemptiónis nostræ munéribus; præsta, quǽsumus miséricors Deus, eórum nobis celebratióne, tuæ protectiónis contra omnes adversitátes subsídium:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Having received the gifts of our redemption, grant, we beseech You, merciful God, that by their celebration we may have the help of Your protection against all adversities","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Defénde, quǽsumus Dómine, beáta"},"d19":{"n":19,"la":"Pro concordia in Congregatione servanda","en":"For keeping concord in the congregation","or":{"la":"Deus largítor pacis, et amátor caritátis: da fámulis tuis veram cum tua voluntáte concórdiam; ut ab ómnibus, quæ nos pulsant, tentatiónibus liberémur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, giver of peace and lover of charity, grant Your servants true concord with Your will; that we may be delivered from all the temptations that assail us","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"His sacrifíciis, Dómine quǽsumus, concéde placátus: ut qui a própriis orámus absólvi delíctis, non gravémur extérnis.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Be appeased, O Lord, we beseech You, by these sacrifices; and grant that we who pray to be loosed from our own sins may not be burdened by those of others","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Spíritum nobis, Dómine, tuæ caritátis infúnde: ut quos uno pane cælésti satiásti; tua fácias pietáte concórdes:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Pour forth on us, O Lord, the spirit of Your charity; that those whom You have fed with the one heavenly bread You may in Your goodness make of one heart","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus largítor pacis, et"},"d20":{"n":20,"la":"Contra persecutores, et male agentes","en":"Against persecutors and evildoers","or":{"la":"Hóstium nostrórum, quǽsumus Dómine, elíde supérbiam; et eórum contumáciam déxteræ tuæ virtúte prostérne:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Crush, we beseech You, O Lord, the pride of our enemies, and by the power of Your right hand lay low their stubbornness","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Huius, Dómine, virtúte mystérii, et a própriis mundémur occúltis, et ab inimicórum liberémur insídiis.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"By the power of this mystery, O Lord, may we be cleansed from our secret sins and delivered from the snares of our enemies","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Protéctor noster áspice Deus: et ab inimicórum nos defénde perículis; ut omni perturbatióne submóta, líberis tibi méntibus serviámus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Look upon us, O God our protector, and defend us from the dangers of our enemies; that, all disturbance being removed, we may serve You with free minds","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Hóstium nostrórum, quǽsumus Dómine"},"d21":{"n":21,"la":"Pro constituto in captivitate, vel in carcere","en":"For one in captivity or in prison","or":{"la":"Deus, qui beátum Petrum Apóstolum, a vínculis absolútum, illǽsum abíre fecísti: fámuli tui in captivitáte pósiti víncula absólve; eúmque, ipsíus méritis, illǽsum abíre concéde:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who loosed blessed Peter the Apostle from his chains and made him go forth unharmed, loose the chains of Your servant held in captivity; and through Peter's merits grant him to go forth unharmed","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Super has, quǽsumus Dómine, hóstias benedíctio copiósa descéndat: quæ captívi huius víncula solvat, et de eius liberatióne nos cito lætíficet.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May an abundant blessing, we beseech You, O Lord, come down upon these offerings; that it may loose the chains of this captive, and soon gladden us with his deliverance","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Preces nostras, quǽsumus Dómine, cleménter exáudi; et per hæc sacraménta, quæ súmpsimus, fámulum tuum a vínculis suæ captivitátis absólve:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Mercifully hear our prayers, we beseech You, O Lord; and through these sacraments which we have received loose Your servant from the chains of his captivity","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui beátum Petrum"},"d22":{"n":22,"la":"Pro inimicis","en":"For enemies","or":{"la":"Deus pacis, caritatísque amátor et custos; da ómnibus inimícis nostris pacem, caritatémque veram: et cunctórum eis remissiónem tríbue peccatórum; nosque ab eórum insídiis poténter éripe:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, lover and guardian of peace and charity, give to all our enemies peace and true charity, and grant them remission of all their sins; and by Your might deliver us from their snares","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Oblátis, quǽsumus Dómine, placáre munéribus: et nos ab inimícis nostris cleménter éripe; eísque indulgéntiam tríbue delictórum.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Be appeased, we beseech You, O Lord, by the gifts we offer; mercifully deliver us from our enemies, and grant them pardon of their sins","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Protéctor noster áspice, Deus: et ab inimicórum nos defénde perículis; ut omni perturbatióne submóta, líberis tibi méntibus serviámus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Look upon us, O God our protector, and defend us from the dangers of our enemies; that, all disturbance being removed, we may serve You with free minds","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus pacis, caritatísque amátor"},"d23":{"n":23,"la":"Pro tentatis et tribulatis","en":"For the tempted and afflicted","or":{"la":"Deus, qui iustíficas ímpium, et non vis mortem peccatóris; maiestátem tuam supplíciter deprecámur: ut fámulos tuos, de tua misericórdia confidéntes, cælésti prótegas benígnus auxílio, et assídua protectióne consérves; ut tibi iúgiter famuléntur, et nullis tentatiónibus a te separéntur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who justify the ungodly and desire not the death of the sinner, we humbly entreat Your majesty that You would graciously protect with heavenly help Your servants who trust in Your mercy, and keep them by Your continual protection; that they may serve You without ceasing and be separated from You by no temptations","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Huius, quǽsumus Dómine, virtúte mystérii, et a própriis nos munda delíctis, et fámulos tuos ab ómnibus absólve peccátis.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"By the power of this mystery, we beseech You, O Lord, cleanse us from our own sins, and absolve Your servants from all their offences","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Puríficent nos, quǽsumus Dómine, sacraménta quæ súmpsimus; et fámulos tuos ab omni culpa líberos esse concéde: ut qui consciéntiæ reátu constringúntur; cæléstis remédii plenitúdine gloriéntur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the sacraments which we have received purify us, we beseech You, O Lord; and grant that Your servants may be free from all guilt; that they who are bound by the guilt of conscience may glory in the fullness of the heavenly remedy","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui iustíficas ímpium"},"d24":{"n":24,"la":"Ad repellendas malas cogitationes","en":"Against evil thoughts","or":{"la":"Omnípotens et mitíssime Deus, réspice propítius ad preces nostras: et líbera corda nostra de malárum tentatiónibus cogitatiónum; ut Sancti Spíritus dignum fíeri habitáculum mereámur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty and most gentle God, look graciously upon our prayers, and free our hearts from the temptations of evil thoughts; that we may deserve to become a worthy dwelling of the Holy Spirit","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Has tibi, Dómine, offérimus oblatiónes pro salúte nostra: quátenus ánimas nostras ab immúndis cogitatiónibus purges, illæsásque custódias, et Sancti Spíritus grátia illumináre dignéris.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"We offer You, O Lord, these oblations for our salvation; that You may cleanse our souls from unclean thoughts and keep them unharmed, and deign to enlighten them with the grace of the Holy Spirit","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Deus, qui illúminas omnem hóminem veniéntem in hunc mundum; illúmina, quǽsumus, corda nostra grátiæ tuæ splendóre: ut digne maiestáti tuæ ministráre; teque ætérna caritáte dilígere valeámus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who enlighten every man that comes into this world, enlighten our hearts, we beseech You, with the splendour of Your grace; that we may worthily serve Your majesty and love You with everlasting charity","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens et mitíssime Deus"},"d25":{"n":25,"la":"Ad postulandam continentiam","en":"For continence","or":{"la":"Ure igne Sancti Spíritus renes nostros et cor nostrum, Dómine: ut tibi casto córpore serviámus; et mundo corde placeámus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Burn our reins and our hearts, O Lord, with the fire of the Holy Spirit; that we may serve You with a chaste body and please You with a clean heart","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Dirúmpe, Dómine, víncula peccatórum nostrórum: et ut sacrificáre tibi hóstiam laudis absolúta libertáte ac munda mente possímus, retríbue quæ ante tribuísti; et salva nos per indulgéntiam, quos dignátus es salváre per grátiam.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Break, O Lord, the bonds of our sins; and that we may sacrifice to You a victim of praise with perfect freedom and a clean mind, restore what You gave before, and save by pardon those whom You deigned to save by grace","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Dómine adiútor et protéctor noster, ádiuva nos: ut reflóreat cor et caro nostra vigóre pudicítiæ, et castimóniæ novitáte; eréptaque de manu tártari, in resurrectiónis gáudium præsentétur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O Lord, our helper and protector, help us; that our heart and flesh may flourish again in the vigour of purity and the newness of chastity, and, snatched from the hand of hell, may be presented in the joy of the resurrection","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Ure igne Sancti Spíritus"},"d26":{"n":26,"la":"Ad postulandam patientiam","en":"For patience","or":{"la":"Deus, qui Unigéniti tui patiéntia, antíqui hostis contrivísti supérbiam: da nobis, quǽsumus, quæ idem pie pro nobis pértulit, digne recólere; sicque exémplo eius, nobis adversántia æquanímiter toleráre:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who by the patience of Your Only-begotten Son crushed the pride of the ancient enemy, grant us, we beseech You, worthily to recall what He lovingly bore for us, and so by His example to bear our adversities with an even mind","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Múnera nostræ oblatiónis, quǽsumus Dómine, súscipe placátus: quæ, ut nobis patiéntiæ donum largíri dignéris, maiestáti tuæ devóta offérimus actióne.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Receive with favour, we beseech You, O Lord, the gifts of our offering, which we present to Your majesty with devout action, that You may deign to bestow on us the gift of patience","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Sacrosáncta, Dómine, suméntes mystéria: amíssam nobis, quǽsumus, reconcílient grátiam; atque munus patiéntiæ in illátis ómnibus, semper et ubíque protegéndo, impértiant:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the most holy mysteries which we receive, O Lord, restore to us, we beseech You, the grace we have lost; and, protecting us always and everywhere, bestow on us the gift of patience in all that befalls us","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui Unigéniti tui"},"d27":{"n":27,"la":"Pro petitione lacrymarum","en":"For the gift of tears","or":{"la":"Omnípotens et mitíssime Deus, qui sitiénti pópulo fontem vivéntis aquæ de petra produxísti; educ de cordis nostri durítia compunctiónis lácrymas: ut peccáta nostra plángere valeámus; remissionémque eórum, te miseránte, mereámur accípere:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty and most gentle God, who brought forth from the rock a fountain of living water for Your thirsting people, bring forth from the hardness of our hearts tears of compunction; that we may bewail our sins, and by Your mercy obtain their forgiveness","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Hanc oblatiónem, quǽsumus Dómine Deus, quam tuæ maiestáti pro peccátis nostris offérimus, propítius réspice: et produc de óculis nostris lacrymárum flúmina, quibus débita flammárum incéndia exstínguere valeámus.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Look graciously, we beseech You, O Lord God, on this offering which we present to Your majesty for our sins, and bring forth from our eyes rivers of tears, by which we may quench the flames we have deserved","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Grátiam Spíritus Sancti, Dómine Deus, córdibus nostris cleménter infúnde: quæ nos gemítibus lacrymárum effíciat máculas nostrórum dilúere peccatórum; atque optátæ nobis, te largiénte, indulgéntiæ præstet efféctum:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Mercifully pour into our hearts, O Lord God, the grace of the Holy Spirit; that it may make us wash away the stains of our sins with sighs and tears, and by Your bounty obtain for us the pardon we desire","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens et mitíssime Deus"},"d28":{"n":28,"la":"Ad postulandam caritatem","en":"For charity","or":{"la":"Deus, qui diligéntibus te facis cuncta prodésse: da córdibus nostris inviolábilem tuæ caritátis afféctum; ut desidéria, de tua inspiratióne concépta, nulla possint tentatióne mutári:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who make all things work together for good to those who love You, give to our hearts an inviolable love of Your charity; that the desires conceived by Your inspiration may be changed by no temptation","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Deus, qui nos ad imáginem tuam sacraméntis rénovas et præcéptis, pérfice gressus nostros in sémitis tuis: ut caritátis donum, quod fecísti a nobis sperári, per hæc, quæ offérimus, sacrifícia, fácias veráciter apprehéndi.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who renew us after Your image by sacraments and precepts, perfect our steps in Your paths; that through these sacrifices which we offer You may make us truly lay hold of the gift of charity which You have caused us to hope for","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Sancti Spíritus grátia, quǽsumus Dómine, corda nostra illúminet; et perféctæ caritátis dulcédine abundánter refíciat:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte eiúsdem Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the grace of the Holy Spirit, we beseech You, O Lord, enlighten our hearts, and abundantly refresh them with the sweetness of perfect charity","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the same Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui diligéntibus te"},"d29":{"n":29,"la":"Ad impetrandam humilitatem","en":"For humility","or":{"la":"Deus, qui supérbis resístis, et grátiam præstas humílibus; concéde nobis veræ humilitátis virtútem, cuius in se formam fidélibus Unigénitus tuus exhíbuit: ut numquam indignatiónem tuam provocémus eláti; sed pótius grátiæ tuæ capiámus dona subiécti:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who resist the proud and give grace to the humble, grant us the virtue of true humility, whose pattern Your Only-begotten Son showed forth in Himself to the faithful; that we may never provoke Your indignation by being lifted up, but rather, being subject, may receive the gifts of Your grace","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Hæc oblátio, Dómine Deus, nobis remissiónem ómnium peccatórum, et veræ humilitátis obtíneat grátiam, simúlque a córdibus nostris concupiscéntiam carnis et oculórum, atque ambitiónem sǽculi áuferat: quátenus sóbrie, iuste, piéque vivéntes, prǽmia consequámur ætérna.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May this oblation, O Lord God, obtain for us the remission of all our sins and the grace of true humility, and take away from our hearts the concupiscence of the flesh and of the eyes and the ambition of the world; that, living soberly, justly and godly, we may obtain everlasting rewards","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Huius, Dómine, sacraménti percéptio peccatórum nostrórum máculas abstérgat; et nos per humilitátis exhibitiónem ad cæléstia regna perdúcat:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the receiving of this sacrament, O Lord, wipe away the stains of our sins, and by the practice of humility lead us to the heavenly kingdom","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui supérbis resístis"},"d30":{"n":30,"la":"Tempore famis","en":"In time of famine","or":{"la":"Da nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, piæ supplicatiónis efféctum; et famem propitiátus avérte: ut mortálium corda cognóscant, et te indignánte, tália flagélla prodíre; et te miseránte, cessáre:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, the effect of our devout supplication, and in Your mercy turn away famine; that the hearts of men may know that such scourges come forth when You are angry and cease when You show mercy","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Deus, qui humáni géneris utrámque substántiam præséntium múnerum et aliménto végetas, et rénovas sacraménto: tríbue quǽsumus, ut eórum et corpóribus nostris subsídium non desit, et méntibus.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who nourish both parts of man's nature, renewing it with the food of present gifts and with the sacrament, grant, we beseech You, that the support of both may not be wanting to our bodies or to our souls","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Gubérna, quǽsumus Dómine, temporálibus aliméntis; quos dignáris ætérnis informáre mystériis:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Govern with temporal food, we beseech You, O Lord, those whom You deign to instruct with eternal mysteries","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Da nobis, quǽsumus Dómine"},"d31":{"n":31,"la":"Ad tempestates repellendas","en":"Against storms","or":{"la":"A domo tua, quǽsumus Dómine, spiritáles nequítiæ repellántur; et aëreárum discédat malígnitas tempestátum:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"From Your house, we beseech You, O Lord, may the spirits of wickedness be driven away, and the malice of storms in the air depart","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Offérimus tibi, Dómine, laudes et múnera, pro concéssis benefíciis grátias referéntes, et pro concedéndis semper supplíciter deprecántes.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"We offer You, O Lord, praises and gifts, giving thanks for benefits received, and ever humbly entreating You for those yet to be granted","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui nos et castigándo sanas, et ignoscéndo consérvas: præsta supplícibus tuis, ut tranquillitátibus huius optátæ consolatiónis lætémur; et dono tuæ pietátis semper utámur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty, everlasting God, who heal us by chastising and preserve us by pardoning, grant to Your suppliants that we may rejoice in the calm of this longed-for consolation, and ever use the gift of Your goodness","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"A domo tua, quǽsumus"},"d32":{"n":32,"la":"Contra pestem animalium","en":"Against a plague of animals","or":{"la":"Deus, qui labóribus hóminum, étiam de mutis animálibus, solátia subrogásti; súpplices te rogámus: ut sine quibus non alitur humána condítio; nostris fácias úsibus non períre:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who have given men the help even of dumb animals in their labours, we humbly beseech You that the creatures without which human life is not sustained may not perish from our use","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Sacrifíciis, Dómine, placátus oblátis, opem tuam nostris tempóribus cleménter impénde.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Appeased, O Lord, by the sacrifices offered, mercifully bestow Your help in our times","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Benedictiónem tuam, Dómine, pópulus fidélis accípiat, qua córpore salvétur, et mente: et animálium, quorum nostris deméritis sævit intéritus; tua nobis parcéndo cleméntia, eum cessáre iúbeas:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May Your faithful people, O Lord, receive Your blessing, by which they may be saved in body and soul; and in Your clemency, sparing us, bid cease the death of the animals that rages for our demerits","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui labóribus hóminum"},"d33":{"n":33,"la":"Tempore terræmotus","en":"In time of earthquake","or":{"la":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui réspicis terram, et facis eam trémere; parce metuéntibus, propitiáre supplícibus: ut cuius iram, terræ fundaménta concutiéntem, expávimus; cleméntiam, contritiónes eius sanántem, iúgiter sentiámus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty, everlasting God, who look upon the earth and make it tremble, spare those who fear, be merciful to those who pray; that we who have dreaded Your wrath that shakes the foundations of the earth may ever feel Your clemency that heals its breaches","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Deus, qui fundásti terram super stabilitátem suam, súscipe oblatiónes et preces pópuli tui; ac treméntis terræ perículis pénitus amótis, divínæ tuæ iracúndiæ terróres in humánæ salútis remédia convérte: ut qui de terra sunt, et in terram reverténtur, gáudeant se fíeri sancta conversatióne cæléstes.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who founded the earth upon its own firmness, receive the offerings and prayers of Your people; and, wholly removing the dangers of the trembling earth, turn the terrors of Your divine anger into remedies for man's salvation; that those who are of the earth and shall return to the earth may rejoice to become citizens of heaven by holy living","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Tuére nos, Dómine quǽsumus, tua sancta suméntes; et terram, quam vídimus nostris iniquitátibus treméntem, supérno múnere firma: ut mortálium corda cognóscant, et te indignánte, tália flagélla prodíre; et te miseránte, cessáre:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Protect us, O Lord, we beseech You, who receive Your holy things; and by Your heavenly gift make firm the earth which we have seen trembling because of our iniquities; that the hearts of men may know that such scourges come forth when You are angry and cease when You show mercy","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui"},"d34":{"n":34,"la":"Pro quacumque re obtinenda","en":"For any need","or":{"la":"Deus refúgium nostrum, et virtus; adésto piis Ecclésiæ tuæ précibus, auctor ipse pietátis: et præsta, ut quod fidéliter pétimus; efficáciter consequámur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, our refuge and strength, be present to the devout prayers of Your Church, You who are the author of devotion; and grant that what we ask in faith we may effectually obtain","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Da miséricors Deus, ut hæc salutáris oblátio, et a própriis nos reátibus indesinénter expédiat, et ad postuláta obtinénda, tibi nos reddat accéptos.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, merciful God, that this saving oblation may ceaselessly free us from our own sins, and make us acceptable to You for obtaining what we ask","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Ad te Dómine clamámus, humíliter deprecántes: ut sicut dixísti, Pétite, et accipiétis; ita per sacri dona mystérii, quæ súmpsimus, exauditiónis tuæ abundántiam petitiónibus nostris concédere dignéris:","lc":"Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre; in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"To You, O Lord, we cry, humbly beseeching that, as You have said, Ask, and you shall receive, so through the gifts of the sacred mystery which we have received You would deign to grant an abundant hearing to our petitions","ec":"Who live and reign with God the Father, in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"note":"Si in Dominica XX. post Octavam Trinitátis, vel in festo S. Martíni, dicénda fúerit Secreta Da miséricors, substituátur Secreta subsequéntis Missæ Súscipe, Dómine.","inc":"Deus refúgium nostrum, et"},"d35":{"n":35,"la":"Pro quacumque tribulatione","en":"In any tribulation","or":{"la":"Ne despícias, omnípotens Deus, pópulum tuum in afflictióne clamántem; sed propter glóriam nóminis tui, tribulátis succúrre placátus:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Despise not, almighty God, Your people crying out in affliction; but for the glory of Your name be appeased, and help the afflicted","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Súscipe, Dómine, propítius hóstias, quibus et te placári voluísti, et nobis salútem poténti pietáte restítui.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Graciously receive, O Lord, the offerings by which You have willed to be appeased, and by Your mighty goodness to restore us to salvation","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Tribulatiónem nostram, quǽsumus Dómine, propítius réspice; et iram tuæ indignatiónis, quam iuste merémur, avérte:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Graciously look upon our tribulation, we beseech You, O Lord, and turn away the wrath of Your indignation which we justly deserve","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Ne despícias, omnípotens Deus"},"d36":{"n":36,"la":"Pro publice pœnitentibus","en":"For public penitents","or":{"la":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, confiténtibus tibi fámulis tuis pro tua pietáte reláxa peccáta: ut non plus eis nóceat consciéntiæ reátus ad pœnam; quam indulgéntia tuæ propitiatiónis prosit ad véniam:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty, everlasting God, in Your goodness forgive the sins of Your servants who confess to You; that guilt of conscience may not harm them unto punishment more than the indulgence of Your mercy may profit them unto pardon","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Præsta, quǽsumus, omnípotens et miséricors Deus: ut hæc salutáris oblátio fámulos tuos, et a própriis reátibus indesinénter expédiat, et ab ómnibus tueátur advérsis.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, we beseech You, almighty and merciful God, that this saving oblation may ceaselessly free Your servants from their own sins, and protect them from all adversities","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Omnípotens et miséricors Deus, qui omnem ánimam pœniténtem, et confiténtem tibi, magis vis emendári, quam pérdere; réspice super hos fámulos tuos: et per hæc sancta sacraménta, quæ súmpsimus, avérte ab eis iram indignatiónis tuæ; et ómnia eórum peccáta dimítte:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty and merciful God, who would rather that every soul that repents and confesses to You be amended than lost, look upon these Your servants; and by these holy sacraments which we have received turn away from them the wrath of Your indignation, and forgive them all their sins","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, confiténtibus"},"d37":{"n":37,"la":"Pro vivis et defunctis communis","en":"For the living and the dead","or":{"la":"Pietáte tua, quǽsumus Dómine, nostrórum solve víncula peccatórum: et intercedénte beáta María semper Vírgine cum ómnibus Sanctis tuis, nos fámulos tuos in omni sanctitáte custódi; omnésque nobis coniúnctos a vítiis purga, virtútibus illústra: pacem et salútem nobis tríbue, hostes rémove, carnália desidéria depélle, ǽris tempériem indúlge, fruges terræ concéde, inimícis nostris caritátem largíre; et ómnibus fidélibus vivis et defúnctis vitam páriter et réquiem ætérnam concéde:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"By Your goodness, we beseech You, O Lord, loose the bonds of our sins; and at the intercession of blessed Mary ever Virgin with all Your Saints, keep us Your servants in all holiness; cleanse from vices all who are joined to us, adorn them with virtues; grant us peace and health, remove our enemies, drive away carnal desires, give good weather, grant the fruits of the earth, bestow charity on our enemies; and to all the faithful, living and dead, grant life and everlasting rest alike","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Deus, qui singulári córporis tui hóstia totíus mundi solvísti delícta: hac oblatióne placátus, máculas scélerum nostrórum abstérge, et ómnium Christianórum vivórum ac defunctórum peccáta dimítte, eísque prǽmia ætérna concéde.","lc":"Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre; in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who by the one sacrifice of Your Body loosed the sins of the whole world, be appeased by this offering; wipe away the stains of our crimes, forgive the sins of all Christians living and dead, and grant them everlasting rewards","ec":"Who live and reign with God the Father, in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Sumpta sacraménta, quǽsumus Dómine, ómnia crímina nostra detérgant: omnémque pravitátem, et hostílem impugnatiónem, méritis sanctæ Dei Genitrícis Maríæ, et ómnium Sanctórum, procul repéllant; et ómnibus fidélibus vivis et defúnctis prosint ad véniam, pro quorum tibi sunt obláta salúte:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the sacraments we have received, we beseech You, O Lord, cleanse away all our crimes, and by the merits of holy Mary, Mother of God, and of all the Saints drive far from us all wickedness and the assaults of the enemy; and may they profit unto pardon all the faithful, living and dead, for whose salvation they were offered to You","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Pietáte tua, quǽsumus Dómine"},"d38":{"n":38,"la":"Pro vivis et defunctis alia","en":"For the living and the dead (another)","or":{"la":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui vivórum domináris simul et mortuórum, omniúmque miseréris, quos tuos fide et ópere futúros esse prænóscis; te súpplices exorámus: ut pro quibus effúndere preces decrévimus, quosque vel præsens sǽculum adhuc in carne rétinet, vel futúrum iam exútos córpore suscépit; intercedéntibus ómnibus Sanctis tuis, pietátis tuæ cleméntia, ómnium delictórum suórum véniam consequántur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Almighty, everlasting God, who have dominion over the living and the dead, and are merciful to all whom You foreknow will be Yours by faith and good works, we humbly beseech You that those for whom we have resolved to pour forth our prayers, whether this present world still holds them in the flesh or the world to come has already received them freed from the body, may, by the intercession of all Your Saints and the clemency of Your goodness, obtain pardon of all their sins","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Deus, cui soli cógnitus est númerus electórum in supérna felicitáte locándus: tríbue quǽsumus, ut intercedéntibus ómnibus Sanctis tuis, universórum, quos in oratióne commendátos suscépimus, et ómnium fidélium nómina beátæ prædestinatiónis liber adscrípta retíneat.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, to whom alone is known the number of the elect to be placed in heavenly happiness, grant, we beseech You, that by the intercession of all Your Saints the names of all who have been commended to our prayers, and of all the faithful, may be kept written in the book of blessed predestination","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Puríficent nos, Dómine quǽsumus, sacraménta, quæ súmpsimus: et intercedéntibus ómnibus Sanctis tuis, præsta, ut hoc tuum sacraméntum non sit nobis reátus ad pœnam; sed intercéssio salutáris ad véniam: sit ablútio scélerum, sit fortitúdo fragílium, sit contra ómnia mundi perícula firmaméntum; sit vivórum atque mortuórum fidélium remíssio ómnium peccatórum:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May the sacraments which we have received purify us, we beseech You, O Lord; and by the intercession of all Your Saints grant that this Your sacrament may not be to us guilt unto punishment, but a saving intercession unto pardon; may it be the washing away of sins, the strength of the weak, a defence against all the dangers of the world, and the remission of all sins for the faithful living and dead","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui"},"bvmAdv":{"la":"De B. Maria V. (in Adventu)","en":"Of Our Lady (Advent)","or":{"la":"Deus, qui de beátæ Maríæ Vírginis útero, Verbum tuum, Angelo nuntiánte, carnem suscípere voluísti; præsta supplícibus tuis: ut qui vere eam genitrícem Dei crédimus; eius apud te intercessiónibus adiuvémur:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who willed that Your Word, at the message of an Angel, should take flesh in the womb of the blessed Virgin Mary, grant to us Your suppliants that we who truly believe her to be the Mother of God may be helped by her intercession with You","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"se":{"la":"In méntibus nostris, quǽsumus Dómine, veræ fídei sacraménta confírma: ut qui concéptum de Vírgine, Deum verum, et hóminem confitémur; per eius salutíferæ resurrectiónis poténtiam, ad ætérnam mereámur perveníre lætítiam.","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Confirm in our minds, we beseech You, O Lord, the mysteries of the true faith; that we who confess Him who was conceived of the Virgin to be true God and true man may, by the power of His saving resurrection, deserve to come to everlasting joy","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Grátiam tuam, quǽsumus Dómine, méntibus nostris infúnde: ut qui Angelo nuntiánte, Christi Fílii tui incarnatiónem cognóvimus; per passiónem eius, et crucem ad resurrectiónis glóriam perducámur:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Pour forth, we beseech You, O Lord, Your grace into our hearts; that we, to whom the Incarnation of Christ Your Son was made known by the message of an Angel, may by His Passion and Cross be brought to the glory of His Resurrection","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui de beátæ"},"bvmNat":{"la":"De B. Maria V. (tempore Nativitatis)","en":"Of Our Lady (Christmastide)","or":{"la":"Deus, qui salútis ætérnæ, beátæ Maríæ virginitáte fecúnda, humáno géneri prǽmia præstitísti: tríbue quǽsumus, ut ipsam pro nobis intercédere sentiámus; per quam merúimus auctórem vitæ suscípere,","lc":"Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who by the fruitful virginity of blessed Mary have bestowed on mankind the rewards of eternal salvation, grant, we beseech You, that we may feel her intercession for us, through whom we were found worthy to receive the Author of life","ec":"our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm","cont":1},"se":{"la":"Munéribus nostris, quǽsumus Dómine, precibúsque suscéptis, intercedénte beáta Dei genitríce María, et cæléstibus nos munda mystériis, et cleménter exáudi.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Having received our gifts and prayers, we beseech You, O Lord, at the intercession of blessed Mary, Mother of God, cleanse us by these heavenly mysteries and mercifully hear us","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"pc":{"la":"Hæc nos communio, Dómine, purget a crímine; et intercedénte beáta Vírgine Dei genitríce María, cæléstis remédii fáciat esse consórtes.","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"May this communion, O Lord, cleanse us from sin, and at the intercession of the blessed Virgin Mary, Mother of God, make us partakers of the heavenly remedy","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"inc":"Deus, qui salútis"},"cruce":{"la":"De Cruce (tempore Paschali)","en":"Of the Cross (Paschaltide)","or":{"la":"Deus, qui pro nobis Fílium tuum Crucis patíbulum subíre voluísti, ut inimíci a nobis expélleres potestátem; concéde nobis fámulis tuis, ut resurrectiónis grátiam consequámur:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, who willed that Your Son should undergo for us the gibbet of the Cross, that You might drive from us the power of the enemy, grant to us Your servants that we may obtain the grace of the resurrection","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"se":{"la":"Purífica nos miséricors Deus, ut Ecclésiæ tuæ preces, quæ tibi gratæ sunt, pia múnera deferéntes, fiant expiátis méntibus gratióres.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Cleanse us, O merciful God, that the prayers of Your Church, which are pleasing to You, bearing devout gifts, may become more pleasing through the cleansing of our minds","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"pc":{"la":"Largíre sénsibus nostris omnípotens Deus: ut per temporálem Fílii tui mortem, quam mystéria veneránda testántur; vitam nobis te dedísse perpétuam confidámus:","lc":"Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant to our minds, almighty God, that through the temporal death of Your Son, which these venerable mysteries attest, we may trust that You have given us everlasting life","ec":"Through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"dm"},"inc":"Deus, qui pro nobis"},"bvm":{"la":"De B. Maria V. (a Purificatione usque ad Adventum)","en":"Of Our Lady (through the year)","or":{"la":"Concéde nos fámulos tuos, quǽsumus Dómine Deus, perpétua mentis et córporis salúte gaudére: et gloriósa beátæ Maríæ semper Vírginis intercessióne, a præsénti liberári tristítia; et ætérna pérfrui lætítia:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, we beseech You, O Lord God, that we Your servants may rejoice in lasting health of mind and body, and by the glorious intercession of blessed Mary ever Virgin be delivered from present sorrow and enjoy eternal gladness","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Tua, Dómine, propitiatióne, et beátæ Maríæ semper Vírginis intercessióne, ad perpétuam atque præséntem hæc oblátio nobis profíciat prosperitátem et pacem.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"By Your mercy, O Lord, and the intercession of blessed Mary ever Virgin, may this offering profit us for prosperity and peace, now and for ever","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Sumptis, Dómine, salútis nostræ subsídiis: da, quǽsumus, beátæ Maríæ semper Vírginis patrocíniis nos ubíque prótegi; in cuius veneratióne hæc tuæ obtúlimus maiestáti:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Having received, O Lord, the helps of our salvation, grant, we beseech You, that we may everywhere be protected by the patronage of blessed Mary ever Virgin, in whose honour we have offered these gifts to Your majesty","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Concéde nos fámulos"},"defPM":{"n":0,"la":"Pro patre et matre simul","en":"For our fathers and mothers","or":{"la":"Deus, qui nos patrem et matrem honoráre præcepísti: miserére cleménter animábus paréntum nostrórum: eorúmque peccáta dimítte; nosque eos in ætérnæ claritátis gáudio fac vidére:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, You have commanded us to honor our father and mother; in Your loving kindness have mercy on the souls of our parents; forgive them their sins, and bring us to see them in the joy of eternal light","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Súscipe sacrifícium Dómine, quod tibi pro animábus paréntum nostrórum offérimus: eísque gáudium sempitérnum in regióne vivórum concéde; nosque cum illis felicitáti Sanctórum coniúnge.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Receive, O Lord, the sacrifice which we offer to You for the souls of our parents; grant them everlasting joy in the land of the living, and in their company let us share in the happiness of the saints","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Cæléstis participátio sacraménti, quǽsumus Dómine, animábus paréntum nostrórum réquiem et lucem obtíneat perpétuam; nosque cum illis grátia tua corónet ætérna:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"We beseech You, O Lord, that this heavenly sacrament of which we have partaken may obtain for the souls of our parents rest and light everlasting; and may Your grace crown us with them for evermore","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, qui nos patrem","src":"Missale O.P. (1939), Orationes diversae pro Defunctis n. 8, p. 124*; English after the St Dominic Missal (1959), in the plural"},"defFr":{"n":0,"la":"Pro defunctis fratribus, propinquis et benefactoribus","en":"For our deceased brethren, relatives and benefactors","or":{"la":"Deus, véniæ largítor, et humánæ salútis auctor, quǽsumus cleméntiam tuam: ut nostræ congregatiónis fratres, soróres, familiáres, et benefactóres, qui ex hoc sǽculo transiérunt; beáta María semper Vírgine intercedénte cum ómnibus Sanctis tuis, ad perpétuæ beatitúdinis consórtium perveníre concédas:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, the giver of pardon and the author of human salvation, we beseech Your clemency, that by the intercession of the blessed Mary ever Virgin, and of all Your saints, You would grant that the brethren, sisters, relatives and benefactors of our Order who have passed out of this life may partake of everlasting bliss","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Deus, cuius misericórdiæ non est númerus, súscipe propítius preces humilitátis nostræ: et animábus fratrum, sorórum, familiárium, et benefactórum nostrórum, quibus tui nóminis dedísti confessiónem, per hæc sacraménta salútis nostræ, cunctórum remissiónem tríbue peccatórum.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, of whose mercy there is no end, favorably receive our humble prayers, and by means of this sacrament of our salvation grant to the souls of our brethren, sisters, relatives and benefactors, who by Your grace confessed Your holy name, remission of all their sins","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Præsta, quǽsumus, omnípotens et miséricors Deus: ut ánimæ fratrum, sorórum, familiárium, et benefactórum nostrórum, pro quibus hoc sacrifícium laudis tuæ obtúlimus maiestáti; per huius virtútem sacraménti a peccátis ómnibus expiátæ, lucis perpétuæ, te miseránte, recípiant beatitúdinem:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"Grant, we beseech You, almighty and merciful God, that the souls of our brethren, sisters, relatives and benefactors, for whom we offer up to Your majesty this sacrifice of praise, may, by virtue of this sacrament, be cleansed from all sin, and by Your mercy receive the happiness of eternal light","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, véniæ largítor","src":"Missale O.P. (1939), In Missis quotidianis Defunctorum, Secunda Oratio, p. 119* (the Secret and Postcommunion as at the weekly Mass)"},"defMis":{"n":0,"la":"Pro his, qui in cœmeterio requiescunt","en":"For those who rest in the cemetery","or":{"la":"Deus, cuius miseratióne ánimæ fidélium requiéscunt: fámulis et famulábus tuis ómnibus, hic et ubíque in Christo quiescéntibus, da propítius véniam peccatórum; ut a cunctis reátibus absolúti, tecum sine fine læténtur:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, by whose mercy the souls of the faithful find rest, mercifully grant to all Your servants and handmaids who rest in Christ, here and everywhere, the pardon of their sins, that, set free from all guilt, they may rejoice with You without end","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"se":{"la":"Pro animábus famulórum famularúmque tuárum, et ómnium catholicórum hic et ubíque in Christo dormiéntium, hóstiam Dómine súscipe benígnus oblátam: ut hoc sacrifício singulári, vínculis horréndæ mortis exútæ, vitam mereántur ætérnam.","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"For the souls of Your servants and handmaids, and of all Catholics who sleep in Christ here and everywhere, receive graciously, O Lord, the sacrifice we offer, that, loosed by this singular sacrifice from the bonds of dreadful death, they may deserve eternal life","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"pc":{"la":"Deus, fidélium lumen animárum, adésto supplicatiónibus nostris: et da fámulis et famulábus tuis, quorum córpora hic et ubíque in Christo requiéscunt; refrigérii sedem, quiétis beatitúdinem, et lúminis claritátem:","lc":"Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","en":"O God, the light of faithful souls, be present to our supplications, and grant to Your servants and handmaids, whose bodies rest here and everywhere in Christ, a place of refreshment, the happiness of rest and the brightness of light","ec":"Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end.","s":"ai"},"inc":"Deus, cuius miseratióne","src":"Missale O.P. (1939), Orationes diversae pro Defunctis n. 9, p. 124* (Latin read from the scan); English: AI translation"}}};
